# Section D frozen sample, candidate M1. Independent reading before the stored fields.
FG-M1-8e79f869ac || cls=CD mod=MUST dom=PE rel=PE pol=ARC-001~ conf=M || actor=agent; act=add only references listed in layout; do not add an outward dependency to make compilation easier; trig=adding project references; scope=project-structure skill; exc=none; time=scaffold; enf=text || test=Counterexample: an inward reference not listed in the layout obeys ARC-001 but breaks only listed. Outward ban is canonical.
FG-M1-a930e21246 || cls=XP mod=MUST_NOT dom=PE rel=NE pol=- conf=M || actor=scaffolder; act=do not git-ignore files intentionally part of Development configuration contract; trig=writing .gitignore; scope=private layout reference; exc=none; time=scaffold; enf=text || test=Counterexample: ignoring appsettings.Development.json breaks no policy directly, as DEP-026 only says what the file should provide. Source says do not, so strength holds.
FG-M1-6b989baa85 || cls=CD mod=MUST_NOT dom=WF rel=PE pol=DEP-003~ conf=M || actor=checker and agent; act=floating errors with no exception; prerelease warned as allowed only on request; do not use floating versions; trig=manifest check, adding packages; scope=check-manifests, add-dependency, props; exc=prerelease on request; time=when invoked and at add; enf=script, not executed || test=DEP-003 allows floating on request; this does not, either in code or in add-dependency step 4 text. Prerelease part matches.
FG-M1-159a4ef4c3 || cls=CD mod=MUST_NOT dom=WF rel=PE pol=DEP-025~ conf=M || actor=hook and user; act=force flags denied unless user-approved marker; resolve the actual problem; trig=flag on command; scope=dependency-commands, add-dependency; exc=marker after explicit user approval; time=PreToolUse; enf=script, not executed || test=Blocks whatever the motive, and gives a user route DEP-025 lacks. Strength could be stronger or not comparable. Marker is self-certified.
FG-M1-29177f63c9 || cls=XP mod=DEFAULT dom=PE rel=NE pol=- conf=M || actor=implementer; act=register readiness checks with tags; trig=readiness checks; scope=health-check skill; exc=none; time=coding; enf=text || test=API-019 addresses what readiness depends on, not tags. Using a different predicate satisfies it. Imperative in a knowledge skill.
FG-M1-71f55c4721 || cls=XP mod=DEFAULT dom=PE rel=NE pol=- conf=M || actor=implementer; act=EF Design package in startup project when migrations come from CLI; dotnet-ef tool; trig=CLI migrations; scope=ef-core skill; exc=none; time=setup; enf=text || test=Tool precondition, no oracle counterpart. Listed under packages through add-dependency.
FG-M1-60a60938b2 || cls=IA mod=MUST_NOT dom=IA rel=NA pol=- conf=M || actor=capability maintainer; act=replacing the persistence technology must not silently lose migration or seeding semantics; trig=replacing technology module; scope=capability contract; exc=none; time=replacement; enf=text || test=Contract for a capability module. Binds who replaces a module, not routine work. ARC-020 covers approval; the semantic-preservation duty is module conformance.
FG-M1-f0f1039dc8 || cls=XP mod=MUST dom=PE rel=NE pol=- conf=M || actor=agent; act=change IEntityTypeConfiguration mappings in adapter layer; trig=mapping change; scope=persistence-change workflow; exc=keep out of core where practical; time=at change; enf=text || test=Counterexample: mapping in OnModelCreating, in Infrastructure, meets ARC-019 and ARC-002 but not this named mechanism.
FG-M1-b25edb284d || cls=XW mod=MUST dom=WF rel=NE pol=- conf=M || actor=hook; act=post-change checks return WARN and ERROR in a block decision to be addressed; trig=post-tool findings; scope=post-tool-use hook; exc=none; time=PostToolUse; enf=hook, not executed || test=Oracle has no such feedback gate. Whether block on a post event binds is host-dependent.
FG-M1-d9b64c54b6 || cls=XW mod=MUST_NOT dom=WF rel=NE pol=- conf=M || actor=hook; act=removal and reference commands need workflow markers; trig=command; scope=dependency-commands; exc=marker; time=PreToolUse; enf=script, not executed || test=Marker protocol has no oracle counterpart. Self-certified.
FG-M1-409529cf47 || cls=XW mod=MUST dom=WF rel=NE pol=- conf=M || actor=scanner; act=report confirmed findings in a fixed shape; trig=security scan; scope=security-scan; exc=OWASP when applicable; time=report; enf=text || test=WF-020 needs severity basis and the confirmed-or-verify split, not a report shape. Sample blocks illustrate; SKILL 143 states the fields. NEEDS VERIFICATION label matches WF-020.
FG-M1-e546910d13 || cls=XW mod=MUST dom=WF rel=NE pol=- conf=M || actor=agent; act=changing capability selection requires an ADR; trig=selection change; scope=capability-selection record, skill; exc=none; time=before change; enf=text || test=A user-approved change with no ADR meets ARC-020 and GOV-017. ADR record is a remainder.
